===Etymology===
[[File:Peripheral Cyanosis due to Ischemia.jpg|thumb|upright|An ischemia in the [[blood vessel]]s of the [[foot#Noun|foot]], leading to {{l|en|cyanosis|t=a [[blue#Noun|blue]] [[discolouration]] of the [[skin#Noun|skin]]}} in the [[toe#Noun|toes]].]]

{{root|en|ine-pro|*seǵʰ-|*say-}}
From {{der|en|NL.|ischaemia}}, from {{der|en|grc|ἴσχαιμος|t=stoppage of blood flow}}, from {{m|grc|ῐ̓́σχω}}, {{m|grc|ἰσχάνω|t=to hold back, restrain; to stay, stop}} (ultimately from {{der|en|ine-pro|*seǵʰ-|t=to hold; to overcome}}) + {{m|grc|αἷμᾰ|t=blood}} (possibly ultimately from {{der|en|ine-pro|*say-|t=thick or viscous liquid}}).<ref>{{R:OED Online|entry=ischaemia {{!}} ischemia|pos=n|id=99924|date=March 2020|nodot=1}}; {{R:Lexico|pos=n}}</ref>

